{"book":"1-kings","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T11:33:13.195890758Z","verse":14,"ref":"1-kings 19:14","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":19,"translation":"And he said, \"I have been zealous with zeal for YHWH, Elohim of hosts, because the children of Israel have forsaken your covenant. ⟨את⟩ your altars they have torn down, and ⟨את⟩ your prophets they have killed with the sword, and I alone have been left, I, by myself. And they have sought ⟨את⟩ my life to take it.\"","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"קנא","gloss":"I have been zealous"},{"surface":"קנאתי","gloss":"with zeal"},{"surface":"ליהוה","gloss":"for YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"צבאות","gloss":"of hosts"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"עזבו","gloss":"they have forsaken"},{"surface":"בריתך","gloss":"your covenant"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"the children of"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Israel"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your altars"},{"surface":"מזבחתיך","gloss":"your altars"},{"surface":"הרסו","gloss":"they have torn down"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"and ⟨את⟩","marks":"your prophets"},{"surface":"נביאיך","gloss":"your prophets"},{"surface":"הרגו","gloss":"they have killed"},{"surface":"בחרב","gloss":"with the sword"},{"surface":"ואותר","gloss":"and I have been left"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"לבדי","gloss":"alone"},{"surface":"ויבקשו","gloss":"and they have sought"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"my life"},{"surface":"נפשי","gloss":"my life"},{"surface":"לקחתה","gloss":"to take it"}]}